:::* Obtain some {i:Fish Bones|Fish Bones|900} from the auction house.
:::* Return to the following areas and speak to Offa each time: {z:Bastok Markets} > {z:Bastok Markets (S)} - trade {p:Offa (S)} the {i:Fish Bones|Fish Bones|900} > {z:Bastok Markets} > {z:Bastok Markets (S)} > {z:Bastok Markets} for the last time and he will end the quest and give you a {i:Rolanberry|Rolanberry|4365}

* Whichever way you decided to complete the previous section, once you have obtained the {i:Rolanberry|Rolanberry|4365} he gives, travel to {z:Bastok Markets (S)} one more time and trade the {i:Rolanberry|Rolanberry|4365} to young {p:Offa}, then return to {z:Bastok Markets} and speak with {p:Offa} there to complete the quest and obtain the {i:Withered Berry|Withered Berry|5675}.

